{"Title":"An Act designating a certain bridge in the town of Harwich as the United States Army Private First Class Joseph C. Blute memorial bridge","BillNumber":"H4485","DocketNumber":"HD4865","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"SKP1","Name":"Sarah K. Peake","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/SKP1","ResponseDate":"2024-02-05T13:26:00.003"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"SKP1","Name":"Sarah K. Peake","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/SKP1","ResponseDate":"2024-02-05T13:26:00.0033333"},{"Id":"JAC0","Name":"Julian Cyr","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/JAC0","ResponseDate":"2024-02-07T16:10:03.6133333"}],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/H4485/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"By Representative Peake of Provincetown, a petition (subject to Joint Rule 12) of Sarah K. Peake and Julian Cyr that a certain bridge on state highway Route 28 in the town of Harwich be designated as the United States Army Private First Class Joseph C. Blute memorial bridge.  Transportation.","DocumentText":"\tSECTION 1.  Bridge number (xxxxx) on state highway route 28 spanning over muddy creek in the town of Harwich shall be designated and known as the United States Army Private First Class Joseph C. Blute Memorial Bridge, in honor and recognition of United States Army Private First Class Joseph C. Blute who lost his life in France on December 17, 1944 while serving in the 324 Infantry, 44 Division.  The Massachusetts department of transportation shall erect and maintain suitable markers and a memorial plaque on the bridge bearing the designation in compliance with the standards of the department.\r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Suspend Rules","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"H33","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/H33"},"Votes":[]},{"Action":"Favorable","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J27","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J27"},"Votes":[]},{"Action":"Place in OD","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"H52","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/H52"},"Votes":[]},{"Action":"Correctly Drawn","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"H36","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/H36"},"Votes":[]},{"Action":"Place in OD","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"S29","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/S29"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[]}